From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Igor Pecovnik <igor@armbian.com>
Date: Wed, 14 Oct 2026 07:02:03 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: thermal: amlogic: keep one clock on S4

The S4 sensor uses the T7 compatible as fallback, but it keeps sampling
without a separate bus clock. Require the bus clock only on T7.

Signed-off-by: Igor Pecovnik <igor@armbian.com>
---
 Documentation/devicetree/bindings/thermal/amlogic,thermal.yaml | 3 +++
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/thermal/amlogic,thermal.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/thermal/amlogic,thermal.yaml
index a0ba5bb7a956..61c1400547c5 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/thermal/amlogic,thermal.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/thermal/amlogic,thermal.yaml
@@ -88,6 +88,9 @@ allOf:
         compatible:
           contains:
             const: amlogic,t7-thermal
+          not:
+            contains:
+              const: amlogic,s4-thermal
     then:
       properties:
         clocks:
